Z||000004||terryk||02-03-2000||05:45 PM||||The Beretta has an Isuzu on V6? I don't think so. It should be a Getrag. If there are three bolts on the top of the housing, it's an Isuzu. <P>Getrag's are clearly bullet proof until they break. I wouldn't do neutral drops.<P>It's like German vs American cars. When a German car breaks it's because it was "abused". When an American car breaks, it's because it is lousy.<P>Didn't mean to turn on the red "oh-sh!^". I was playing. Should be the blue suffocation face.<BR>[This message has been edited by terryk (edited 02-03-2000).]<p>[This message has been edited by terryk (edited 02-03-2000).]||||reg||11
